==Strategy==

Spam [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Cow Cat]]. If your Crazed Cow happens to be underleveled, spam meatshields and protect strong area attackers like [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]].

==Trivia==
*Like all [[Cats in the Snow]] stages, Snow at Dawn's Japanese name, Naguri Yuki ("Violent Snow"), is a reference to a song, in this case "[https://youtu.be/FwXluXjBaqw Nagori Yuki]" ("Unseasonal Snow") by [[wikipedia:ja:イルカ (歌手)|Iruka]].

